# Internal operational docs — deliberately not published.
#
# This repository is public. Both files are candid in the way a handover
# between maintainers should be and a shop window should not: the known-gaps
# list, which areas have no test coverage, where the blank-page crashes came
# from, and why `check-returning-shop` is deliberately inert. That is a map of
# the soft spots in an app that takes student payments.
#
# AI_STATE_HANDOFF.md was tracked until now, so older revisions remain readable
# in the git history on GitHub. Untracking it stops further updates being
# published; it does not retract what is already there.
AI_STATE_HANDOFF.md
LAUNCH_RUNBOOK.md
